===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
[[File:Kuechenmaschine Kenwood fcm.jpg|thumb|right]]

# A [[machine]] outfitted with (typically [[blunt]]) [[blade]]s with which it [[mix]]es or [[beat]]s ingredients in a [[bowl]] below.
# A non-alcoholic drink (such as [[lemonade]], [[Coca-Cola]] or [[fruit juice]]) that is added to [[spirit]]s to make [[cocktail]]s.
#: ''Do we have any '''mixers'''? I don't want to drink this [[vodka]] neat.''

